# Visual identity

Before changing UI in `apps/web`, read `docs/design/design.md`.

- Tokens, type, radius, and components come from that file.
- Do not mention or reuse another company's brand.
- Do not extend the leftover paper / copper / Fraunces look.
- User-facing copy lives in `apps/web/src/i18n` (en, pt, es).
